{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:i1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin the process, Rental Items are Returned to the Store."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers process initialization and the first return action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_ret->i2",
        "action:i2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Customer returns the items to the store,\" then we can continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the first alternative return path and its condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_ret->i3",
        "action:i3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Delivery Crew picks-up items at the event site,\" then we also continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the second alternative return path and rejoins the flow."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:i4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "During this step, the items are counted and compared to the original contract."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match for the counting and comparison step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_stat->i5",
        "action:i5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Order is complete and all items were returned,\" then we proceed with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the complete-order branch and its guard/action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_stat->i6",
        "action:i6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Order is incomplete and items are missing,\" we still continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the incomplete-order branch."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_stat->i7",
        "action:i7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Similarly, if the \"Order is complete but items are damaged,\" we email the customer to inform them of the damage and additional charges."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the damaged-order branch. Splitting the email step does not change behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_pck1->i8",
        "action:i8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After this, if the \"Items are packed for an existing order,\" we continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the packing alternative and its condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_pck1->i9",
        "action:i9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Alternatively, if the \"Items are stored for future orders,\" we also continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the storing alternative and its condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:i10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "In case of missing items and replacement charges, we email the customer to inform them."
      ],
      "justification": "Paraphrased but behaviour-preserving email action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:i11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Additionally, if there are damaged items and additional charges, we temporarily take them out of inventory."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match for removing damaged items from inventory."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_cus->i12",
        "action:i12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Customer returns the missing items,\" we continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the positive customer-return outcome."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_cus->i13",
        "action:i13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Customer does not return the missing items,\" we still continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the negative customer-return outcome."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_rep->i14",
        "action:i14"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Items are repaired and added into inventory,\" we continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the repair branch and outcome."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_rep->i15",
        "action:i15",
        "action:i_email_dmg"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "On the other hand, if the \"Items can't be repaired and are discarded,\" we email the customer with replacement charges."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the discard branch. Action i_email_dmg covers the explicit email step mentioned in the text."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:i16"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Lastly, the items are packed for an existing order."
      ],
      "justification": "Handles flow convergence and the final packing step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_end->i18",
        "action:i18",
        "guard:b_end->e_end"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the \"Items are stored for future orders,\" we also continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the final storage alternative, the implicit completion path, and process termination."
    }
  ],
